{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05494","headline":"登翅头山题俨公石壁 · 包融","name":"登翅头山题俨公石壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨登翅头山，山曛黄雾起。\n却瞻迷向背，直下失城市。\n暾日衔东郊，朝光生邑里。\n扫除诸烟氛，照出衆楼雉。\n青爲洞庭山，白是太湖水。\n苍茫远郊树，倏忽不相似。\n万象以区别，森然共盈几。\n坐令开心胸，渐觉落尘滓。\n北岩千余仞，结庐谁家子。\n愿陪中峯游，朝暮白云里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05494.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05494","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}